OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, although a few heavy showers
OL,7,Fare possible. Staying mainly dry
OL,8,Fovernight, but with eastern parts
OL,9,Flikely seeing further showers
OL,10,Fspreading north. These perhaps heavy
OL,11,Fand with frequent lightning across
OL,12,FKent, although the heaviest rain
OL,13,Fpossibly remaining offshore.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FAny overnight rain easing.
OL,16,Fleaving a largely dry morning with
OL,17,Fsunny spells. Into the afternoon
OL,18,Fscattered showers are expected to
OL,19,Fdevelop, heavy at times, but with some
OL,20,Fparts staying dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
